  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly. Distribute into culture vessels under a N2 gas atmosphere (e.g., 45 ml in 100 ml serum bottle), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly. Filter--sterilize and store under a N2 gas atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly. Filter--sterilize and store under a N2 gas atmosphere. Then add the following solution (filter--sterilized) aseptically and anaerobically:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "To complete medium, add 2.5 ml Solution B and 2.5 ml Solution C to the culture vessels containing 45.0 ml of the medium (Solution A)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "Dissolve FeCl2・4H2O in HCl solution at first. Then add 300 ml distilled water and dissolve the remaining components. Fill up to 1.0 L."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "comment": "Dissolve Na2WO4・2H2O and Na2SeO3・5H2O in 10 mM NaOH solution at first. Then dilute with distilled water."
